cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the paper."
title: "GDCE-I: Graph Diffusion Counterfactual Explanation via Inversion"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of GDCE-I, a graph counterfactual explainer that
  inverts a guided discrete denoising diffusion trajectory, together with the
  shared-classifier evaluation protocol and the scripts that reproduce every
  table and figure of the paper.
